    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameManage.Download.Threads">Max threads</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameManage.Download.Threads.ToolTip">More threads speed up rate-limited downloads, but too many threads may cause severe lag during downloads.&#x0a;In general, 64 threads are sufficient for most download needs.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameManage.Download.SpeedLimit">Speed limit</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameManage.Download.SpeedLimit.ToolTip">Set a download speed cap to prevent other internet-dependent programs from freezing during downloads</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameManage.Download.TargetFolder">Target folder</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameManage.Download.TargetFolder.Hint">Go to Launch → Instance Selection → Folder List to change the download target folder.&#x0a;Right-click on a folder or game instance to open the corresponding folder.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameManage.Download.InstallBehavior">Install behavior</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameManage.Download.AutoSelectInstance">Auto-select instance after installation</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameManage.Download.FixAuthlib">Upgrade Authlib for some versions</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameManage.Download.FixAuthlib.ToolTip">Some MC versions (e.g. 1.16.5) have a bug that may cause multiplayer to be disabled when using offline authentication.&#x0a;PCL can attempt to upgrade the Authlib support library for these versions to fix the issue.&#x0a;This setting only applies to newly installed instances.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameManage.Download.Unlimited">Unlimited</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.GameManage.Download.Threads.TooManyWarning.Message">Setting too many download threads may cause severe lag during downloads.&#x0a;64 threads are generally sufficient for most download needs. Unless you know what you are doing, it is not recommended to set more!</sys:String>
